### Configuration on Kubernetes

1: Enable Container API using gcloud as container services & Kubernates is a part of container API
	$ gcloud services enable container.googleapis.com
	Operation "operations/acf.p2-1040682241529-2c36242c-3cce-4fad-b2da-e98d960ecdb6" finished successfully

2: Create a GKE Cluster

	Create a GKE cluster with Autopilot Mode with 3 nodes
    
	$ gcloud container clusters create-auto k8s-cluster --region asia-south2

    Creating cluster k8s-cluster in asia-south2... Cluster is being health-checked...
    
